    {
      "text": "The web spun by Spinarak can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this Pokémon can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "The web spun by Spinarak can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this Pokémon can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It waits intently until its preferred prey, Cutiefly, gets caught in its web. In fact, it’s quite a patient Pokémon.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some fishermen weave its sturdy thread into nets to catch fish Pokémon.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "With threads from its mouth, it fashions sturdy webs that won’t break even if you set a rock on them.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although the poison from its fangs isn’t that strong, it’s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
  ],
